{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t慈雲山慈正邨正康樓一個單位清晨發生火警，警方說，起火單位一名男住戶報稱臉部燒傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事發在清晨5時許，現場冒出大量濃煙，消防到場將火撲熄，約250名居民自行疏散到安全地方暫避。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：鄭皓璟\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T23:19:37.333753+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T22:46:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T23:37:42.275756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T23:17:39.864222+00:00","content_hash":"558396b14668dff31dbc7bf4f6b16a6e38a7d9d10cdad0778b5954923a33a1ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}